# R15: a nested dashboard gets its parent's creation environment.
@prefix adp: <https://example.org/acme/data-platform#> .

adp:salesTeam a adp:ProductTeam .
adp:salesApp a adp:AIAnalyticalApplication ; adp:createdIn adp:DEV ; adp:promotedTo adp:ACC .
adp:salesDash a adp:Dashboard, adp:SubPlatformResource ; adp:belongsTo adp:salesApp .
